  "setupNotes": [
    "Normal launch authenticated existing f44 bootstrap key directly; proposed workstation-key fallback was not used. Only the generated run public key was appended.",
    "Initial preflight failed at blank first frame; failed-launch shutdown left a NUL-filled new authorized_keys extent and a zero-byte owned unit. Malformed key line retained, newline-separated own public key appended and synced. Exact empty owned unit renamed before repair.",
    "Cinnamon screensaver is demand-activated; GetActive verifies it even when NameHasOwner is initially false.",
    "Deliberate idle-delay600 drift was refused by check-only preflight. SSH reboot required interactive authorization; visible terminal/session requests did not change uptime. No password entered. Synced owned guest then QMP system_reset; new boot ID and startup readback prove fresh boot restoration.",
    "Final complete QMP frame was reviewed, native X11 unlocked active session and policy rechecked; overlay retired after export verification."
  ],
